<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
<title>FSD Experiment 9 - Output</title>

<style>
body {
  font-family: Arial;
  background: #f5f5f5;
  margin: 0;
}

header {
  background: #2c3e50;
  color: white;
  text-align: center;
  padding: 15px;
}

.nav {
  text-align: center;
  margin: 15px;
}

.nav button {
  padding: 10px 15px;
  margin: 5px;
  border: none;
  background: #3498db;
  color: white;
  cursor: pointer;
  border-radius: 5px;
}

.box {
  background: white;
  margin: 20px auto;
  padding: 20px;
  width: 80%;
  border-radius: 10px;
  display: none;
}

.active {
  display: block;
}

.output {
  background: black;
  color: #00ff00;
  padding: 15px;
  border-radius: 5px;
  font-family: monospace;
}
</style>
</head>

<body>

<header>
  <h1>FSD EXPERIMENT 9 - OUTPUT DASHBOARD</h1>
</header>

<div class="nav">
  <button onclick="show('d1')">9.1 Output</button>
  <button onclick="show('d2')">9.2 Output</button>
  <button onclick="show('d3')">9.3 Output</button>
</div>

<!-- 9.1 OUTPUT -->
<div id="d1" class="box active">
<h2>Experiment 9.1 - Dockerized React App Output</h2>

<div class="output">
✔ Docker Image Built Successfully<br>
✔ Container Started on Port 3000<br>
✔ Nginx Server Running<br><br>

React App Output:<br>
----------------------------------<br>
🚀 Welcome to React Application<br>
⚛️ Running inside Docker Container<br>
🌐 Served using Nginx Web Server<br>
----------------------------------
</div>
</div>

<!-- 9.2 OUTPUT -->
<div id="d2" class="box">
<h2>Experiment 9.2 - CI/CD Pipeline Output</h2>

<div class="output">
✔ GitHub Actions Triggered<br>
✔ Dependencies Installed<br>
✔ Build Successful<br>
✔ Tests Passed<br>
✔ Docker Image Pushed to Registry<br><br>

Pipeline Status:<br>
----------------------------------<br>
🟢 Build: SUCCESS<br>
🟢 Test: SUCCESS<br>
🟢 Deploy: SUCCESS<br>
----------------------------------
</div>
</div>

<!-- 9.3 OUTPUT -->
<div id="d3" class="box">
<h2>Experiment 9.3 - AWS Deployment Output</h2>

<div class="output">
✔ EC2 Instance Running<br>
✔ Docker Container Deployed<br>
✔ Load Balancer Active<br>
✔ Auto Scaling Enabled<br><br>

Deployment Status:<br>
----------------------------------<br>
🌐 Application URL:<br>
http://your-ec2-public-ip<br><br>

🟢 Status: LIVE & RUNNING<br>
⚡ Scalable Architecture Enabled<br>
----------------------------------
</div>
</div>

<script>
function show(id) {
  let boxes = document.querySelectorAll('.box');
  boxes.forEach(b => b.classList.remove('active'));
  document.getElementById(id).classList.add('active');
}
</script>

</body>
</html>
